      "role": "user",
      "content": "the helpline stuff doesn't change the reality though. it's just the same cycle every single day. i look at him and i just feel this massive wave of resentment and then guilt, and then i'm just exhausted. i feel like i'm stuck in this room that's slowly filling up with water and there's no way out. i sink into bed and i just wish i could just sleep and never wake up. like, actually just stop.",
